  "question": {
    "text": "Point <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> lies on the line <math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Then the coordinates of the points farthest from the line which are at a distance of&nbsp;<math><mn>10</mn></math> units from the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> are&nbsp;"
