  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0009_701ea62259c5.png\" style=\"width:1.95347in;height:1.79375in\" /><br />There are two points <math><mi>A</mi></math> &amp; <math><mi>B</mi></math> which are at a distance of&nbsp;<math><mn>10</mn></math> units from <math><mi>P</mi></math> and farthest ( <math><mn>10</mn></math> unit distance) from the line <math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>The slope of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> {Because the slope of <math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></math> is <math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> }<br />Let line <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> makes an angle <math><mi>&#952;</mi></math> with <math><mi>x</mi></math>-axis then <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi></math> or <math><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,10</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> or <math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1,</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi></math> or <math><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7,13</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> or <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
